|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Cb1 | any | NEG | none | no | conflict \| dev-absent \| conflict-uncorroborated | none |
| Cb2 | CONTRA | not NEG | none | no | future \| newest-not-T \| non-monotonic \| malformed | none |
